@startuml SQ-01
title SQ-01 Registration (e-mail + password) & Login [C method / P mechanism]
actor Player
participant "Game Client" as C
participant "Backend API\n(Laravel)" as B
participant "Queue worker" as Q
participant "E-mail provider" as M
database MySQL as DB
== Registration ==
Player -> C : e-mail, password, display name
C -> B : POST /v1/auth/register {email, password, displayName}\nX-Client-Version, X-Platform
B -> B : validate (FormRequest), rate-limit per IP (SEC-008)
B -> DB : check display name unique (case-insensitive, BR-019)
alt name taken / email taken
  B --> C : 409 NAME_TAKEN | 422 VALIDATION_FAILED (generic for email)
else ok
  B -> B : hash password (SEC-004)
  B -> DB : INSERT user_account, player_profile, competitive_record,\nstarter parts (inventory_item) [A-04]
  B -> Q : queue VerifyEmail notification
  Q -> M : send verification link
  B --> C : 201 {userId, emailVerified:false}
end
Player -> M : opens link
M -> B : GET /v1/auth/email/verify/{id}/{hash}?signature=…
B -> DB : UPDATE user_account.email_verified_at
== Login ==
C -> B : POST /v1/auth/login {email, password}
alt client version < minimum (FR-006)
  B --> C : 426 CLIENT_UPDATE_REQUIRED {storeUrl}
else valid
  B -> DB : INSERT auth_session (refresh token hash); create Sanctum access token (15 min)
  B --> C : 200 {accessToken, refreshToken, user}
else invalid
  B --> C : 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
end
== Password reset (FR-004) ==
C -> B : POST /v1/auth/password/forgot {email}
B -> Q : queue reset link (60 min, single use)
B --> C : 202 (same response whether or not e-mail exists)
@enduml
